      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lia̱a̱ kua̱r ni Thɔɔl",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä cua ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl joc, kä cua kɛ näk ɛlɔ̱ŋ Pääm Gil-bwä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt Thɔɔl cop kɛnɛ gaatkɛ. Kä cukɛ Jo-na-than kɛnɛ Ä-bi-na-dab kɛ Mal-ki-cuwa gaat Thɔɔl näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ko̱r cuɛ bɛc bɛ̈c ɛlɔ̱ŋ kä Thɔɔl, kä cua jɛ moc buɔ̱t mi di̱i̱t kɛ bäär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ro̱o̱m muɔ̱tdɛ jiök i̱, “Käni mutdu, kä näk ɣä kɛ jɛ, kɛ ɣöö /ci nɛy ti thil Kuoth ti ɣä bi ben yak.” Duundɛ ɣöö /ken ro̱o̱m muɔ̱tdɛ jɛ la̱t. Kɛ ɣöö cɛ dual ɛlɔ̱ŋ. Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ cu Thɔɔl mutdɛ ka̱n kä cuɛ rɔ pi̱em thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ro̱o̱m muɔ̱tdɛ jɛ nɛn a ci Thɔɔl li̱w, cuɛ rɔ pi̱em muɔ̱tdɛ bä, kä cuɛ li̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu Thɔɔl li̱w kɛnɛ gaatkɛ da̱ŋ diɔ̱k kɛ ji̱ dhɔaarɛ diaal kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal tin cieŋ rɛy lo̱o̱lä ɛ nɛn ɛn ɣöö ci kɛ rɔ bar, kä ca Thɔɔl kɛnɛ gaatkɛ näk, cukɛ wi̱i̱kiɛn päl lukɛ rɔ bar. Kä cu ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ben cieŋ thi̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ruɔ̱ndɛ, mëë ci ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt ben ba nɛy tin ci li̱w ben guic, cukɛ Thɔɔl kɛnɛ gaatkɛ jek cikɛ li̱w Pääm Gil-bwä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ wi̱cdɛ ŋok, kä cua giwgiwdɛ ka̱n, kä cukɛ naath jäk kä rɛy cieŋ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt diaal nöŋkɛ thok kuthkiɛn kɛnɛ nɛɛkiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ giwgiwdɛ la̱th rɛy duëël kuthnikiɛn, kä cua wi̱cdɛ naŋ duëël kuɔthdiɛn ni Da-gon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö mëë ci ji̱ Ya-bec-gil-yad diaal min ca lät kä Thɔɔl ɛ ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt liŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cu wutni ko̱o̱r diaal jiɛɛn, cukɛ ri̱ŋ Thɔɔl kɛnɛ ri̱ŋ gankɛ wä ka̱n, kä cu kɛ nööŋ kä Ya-bec. Kä cukɛ cɔ̱wkiɛn ben kony thar lua̱l kä Ya-bec, kä cukɛ thɛɛk kɛ ni̱n bärɔw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu Thɔɔl li̱w kɛ thil ŋäthädɛ kɛ Kuoth Nhial. /Kenɛ luek Kuɔth Nhial tit, kä cuɛ wä thiec ni gua̱n kolaaŋni kɛ ca̱r, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/kɛnɛ ca̱r thiec kä Kuoth Nhial. Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ ci Kuoth Nhial jɛ näk, kä cuɛ kuäär riet Dee-bid gat Jɛthi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
